<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-LEICESTER RELEASE RORY UNDERWOOD.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-LEICESTER RELEASE RORY UNDERWOOD.</headline>
<dateline>LEICESTER, England 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rory Underwood, capped a record 85 times by England, has been released by Leicester.</p>
<p>The former England winger has been with the club for 14 years.</p>
<p>Underwood said the increased demands of the professional game had made it difficult for him to fulfil work, family and playing commitments.</p>
